            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401709"
            ]
          },
          "721401709": {
            "id": "721401709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "噗…哈哈哈哈哈！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401710"
            ]
          },
          "721401710": {
            "id": "721401710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "好啦好啦，你们别吵啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401711"
            ]
          },
          "721401711": {
            "id": "721401711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "我这边也还不错，不过还有件事想要拜托一下。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401714"
            ]
          },
          "721401714": {
            "id": "721401714",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "#嗯，也没有别的要求啦，只是需要{NICKNAME}再帮我开采一些晶石。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401715"
            ]
          },
          "721401715": {
            "id": "721401715",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "请相信我，我一定会好好报答你的…只要你相信我。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401716"
            ]
          },
          "721401716": {
            "id": "721401716",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我相信你，可是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401717"
            ]
          },
          "721401717": {
            "id": "721401717",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "可是…？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7214019",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721401901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721401901": {
            "id": "721401901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "这些晶化骨髓应该足够了。接下来我就要启程去冒险咯！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401902"
            ]
          },
          "721401902": {
            "id": "721401902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "还是好担心这孩子…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401905"
            ]
          },
          "721401905": {
            "id": "721401905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "嗯！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401906"
            ]
          },
          "721401906": {
            "id": "721401906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂，长次你不要再满嘴跑舌头啦！还好是遇上了我们…不然会被打的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401907"
            ]
          },
          "721401907": {
            "id": "721401907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "还有还有，遇到坏人想要套话，也不要对他们讲实话！一定要乱胡诌！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401908"
            ]
          },
          "721401908": {
            "id": "721401908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "还有还有…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401909"
            ]
          },
          "721401909": {
            "id": "721401909",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "派蒙变成老外婆了呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401910"
            ]
          },
          "721401910": {
            "id": "721401910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这么小的孩子自己一个人出去冒险，谁会放心啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401911"
            ]
          },
          "721401911": {
            "id": "721401911",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我相信他。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401912"
            ]
          },
          "721401912": {
            "id": "721401912",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…真是的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401913"
            ]
          },
          "721401913": {
            "id": "721401913",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "哈哈哈哈！谢谢你们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401914"
            ]
          },
          "721401914": {
            "id": "721401914",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "希望我们以后还会见面。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401915"
            ]
          },
          "721401915": {
            "id": "721401915",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "一定要注意安全呀…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401916"
            ]
          },
          "721401916": {
            "id": "721401916",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "我没问题的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401917"
            ]
          },
          "721401917": {
            "id": "721401917",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "接下来我应该会去踏鞴砂，妈妈曾在那里工作过。或许还有人能告诉我她是否经过那边。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401918"
            ]
          },
          "721401918": {
            "id": "721401918",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "再然后…我会想办法去鸣神岛。然后搭一艘至冬国的商船…之后的事情，随机应变。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721401919"
            ]
          },
          "721401919": {
            "id": "721401919",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "……"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7214020",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721402001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721402001": {
            "id": "721402001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "你们好，又见面了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402002"
            ]
          },
          "721402002": {
            "id": "721402002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "且慢——让我猜猜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402003"
            ]
          },
          "721402003": {
            "id": "721402003",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「拜托再给我弄来一大堆晶化骨髓…」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402004"
            ]
          },
          "721402004": {
            "id": "721402004",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「…我有急用，呜呜…」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402005"
            ]
          },
          "721402005": {
            "id": "721402005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这就是你想说的吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402006"
            ]
          },
          "721402006": {
            "id": "721402006",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，当然不是啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402007"
            ]
          },
          "721402007": {
            "id": "721402007",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你的旅途如何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402008"
            ]
          },
          "721402008": {
            "id": "721402008",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "还好，只是还没有找到妈妈的踪迹…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402009"
            ]
          },
          "721402009": {
            "id": "721402009",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#没关系，我们也会帮忙的，对吧？{NICKNAME}？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402010"
            ]
          },
          "721402010": {
            "id": "721402010",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们尽力而为。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402011"
            ]
          },
          "721402011": {
            "id": "721402011",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "#嗯，我就知道{NICKNAME}可以信赖！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7214021",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721402102"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721402102": {
            "id": "721402102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "请你自己看看吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402103"
            ]
          },
          "721402103": {
            "id": "721402103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "唔…好吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402104"
            ]
          },
          "721402104": {
            "id": "721402104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "我会读的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402105"
            ]
          },
          "721402105": {
            "id": "721402105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "她的选择可能有些自私…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402106"
            ]
          },
          "721402106": {
            "id": "721402106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "但请不要为此责怪她。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402107"
            ]
          },
          "721402107": {
            "id": "721402107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "…我明白的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402108"
            ]
          },
          "721402108": {
            "id": "721402108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "但我会继续找她，只有找到她，这些东西才真正有意义。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402109"
            ]
          },
          "721402109": {
            "id": "721402109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这孩子…怎么这么执拗呀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7214023",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721402301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721402301": {
            "id": "721402301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，没想到又能在这里看见你！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402302"
            ]
          },
          "721402302": {
            "id": "721402302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好久不见啦！八酝岛外的世界怎么样？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402303"
            ]
          },
          "721402303": {
            "id": "721402303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "这里比家乡富裕很多，也有更多好吃的料理、好玩的东西。但是…我不太喜欢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402304"
            ]
          },
          "721402304": {
            "id": "721402304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？为什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402305"
            ]
          },
          "721402305": {
            "id": "721402305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "这里的人都缺少了些什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402306"
            ]
          },
          "721402306": {
            "id": "721402306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "从前在八酝岛生活的时候，大御所大人对我来说遥远安详…我们不会在意她在哪里，但是我们相信她就在这里，注视保护着我们，规定我们怎么过日子，成为什么样的人…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402307"
            ]
          },
          "721402307": {
            "id": "721402307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "但是在这里，大御所大人覆盖一切，威压一切…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402308"
            ]
          },
          "721402308": {
            "id": "721402308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "唉，我也说不清楚啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402309"
            ]
          },
          "721402309": {
            "id": "721402309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "对了，关于我的妈妈…你有发现什么吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402310"
            ]
          },
          "721402310": {
            "id": "721402310",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们还在努力。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721402311"
            ]
          },
          "721402311": {
            "id": "721402311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "长次",
            "text": "没关系的，有消息再告诉我也不迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
